        {
          "evidence": "README.md \u00a7\u201cShape of the proof\u201d and formalization.yaml describe the exact-logarithmic LocalLogMoment result as part of the proof chain, but Solution.lean proves main_upper through SymmetricDeletion.exists_upperBoundAt. The deletion chain instead invokes LocalSymmetricMoment.operator_moment_le directly in NearBlockMoment.block_moment_le, obtaining the required scheduled order through RestrictedBlockFamily, NestedDeletionFamily.weak_screen, and ten BilinearHighOrder doublings. LocalLogMoment is imported only by the MI32 umbrella module and is not used by this proof term.",
